cuems-engine (0.1.0rc2-2) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * cuems-engine-mock: fix wrapper install path from /usr/local/bin to /usr/bin
    - /etc/cuems/settings.xml configures player paths under /usr/bin/
    - wrappers at /usr/local/bin/ were never found by the node engine

